<section class="section">
  <h2>Ways to help — with or without showing up</h2>
  <ul class="feature-list">
    <li><strong>Event day help.</strong> Run a booth, check families in, or set up and tear down — usually one or two hours.</li>
    <li><strong>Behind the scenes.</strong> Cut paper, prep materials, count box tops — from home, on your own schedule.</li>
    <li><strong>Planning committees.</strong> Help shape the book fair, restaurant nights, and family events.</li>
    <li><strong>Share a skill.</strong> Design a flyer, take photos, translate, or bring whatever you're great at.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The best way to hear about upcoming opportunities is a
    <a href="/calendar/">PTSA meeting</a> — but you never need to attend meetings
    to help. Some of the most important work happens behind the scenes. 💚
  </p>
</section>

